  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Treatment and Laboratory Capacity of DOH Bagong Urgent Care and Ambulatory Services (BUCAS) Center to Achieve Health Equity in the Luzon Region, Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through improving access to urgent outpatient healthcare for BUCAS center targeted toward medically underserved and vulnerable population achieve Universal Healthcare and Health Equity&#x25a3; &#xbd80;&#xce74;&#xc2a4;&#xc13c;&#xd130; &#xae34;&#xae09; &#xc9c4;&#xb8cc; &#xbc0f; &#xc678;&#xb798; &#xc11c;&#xbe44;&#xc2a4; &#xc811;&#xadfc;&#xc131; &#xac15;&#xd654;
&#x25a3; &#xbd80;&#xce74;&#xc2a4;&#xc13c;&#xd130; &#xae34;&#xae09; &#xc9c4;&#xb8cc; &#xbc0f; &#xc678;&#xb798; &#xc11c;&#xbe44;&#xc2a4; &#xd488;&#xc9c8; &#xc81c;&#xace0;
&#x25a3; &#xbd80;&#xce74;&#xc2a4;&#xc13c;&#xd130; &#xc6b4;&#xc601;&#xad00;&#xb9ac; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;
&#x25a3; &#xbd80;&#xce74;&#xc2a4;&#xc13c;&#xd130; &#xd1b5;&#xd569; &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed;&#xc0ac;&#xd68c; &#xc758;&#xb8cc;&#xc11c;&#xbe44;&#xc2a4; &#xc804;&#xb2ec;&#xccb4;&#xacc4;(HCPN) &#xac1c;&#xc120;
&#x25a3; &#xbd80;&#xce74;&#xc2a4;&#xc13c;&#xd130; &#xad6d;&#xac00; &#xc815;&#xcc45; &#xcc45;&#xc784;&#xc131; &#xbc0f; &#xadfc;&#xac70;&#xae30;&#xbc18; &#xc758;&#xc0ac;&#xacb0;&#xc815; &#xac15;&#xd654;
&#x25a3; &#xbd80;&#xce74;&#xc2a4;&#xc13c;&#xd130; &#xc9c0;&#xc18d;&#xac00;&#xb2a5;&#xd55c; &#xc6b4;&#xc601;&#xad00;&#xb9ac; &#xccb4;&#xacc4; &#xd655;&#xb9bd;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To achieve UHC and Health Equity by enhancing Urgent and Ambulatory medical services at BUCAS Centers The project will be implemented across all BUCAS Centers in the Luzon region of the Philippines. As of September 2025, there are 27 BUCAS Centers in the Luzon region. Among these, five BUCAS Centers have been selected as key modeling sites.</narrative>
  </description>
